	(text "SENSING (record sections 10, 12). U11 INA228 across R2 on the Input sheet via Kelvin taps INA_SENSE_P/N: route as a tight pair, INA beside the shunt, quiet ground, far from switch nodes.\n1 mOhm: 10 mV at 10 A, inside the +-163.84 mV range; die temperature = board temperature (the thermal witness per the heatsink ruling).\nALERT (open drain) = INA_ALERT_N: also the motor switch EN/UVLO, so over-current / over-power / over-temp limits cut the motor with no MCU (section 12).\nA0/A1 = GND (address 0x40). R24/R25 I2C pull-ups: check whether the stamp or add-on already fits them before populating (SPEC open item on the shared bus).\nJ6 thermistor: any NTC from any drawer into an ADC1 pin (section 10). J7 4-pin PWM fan with tach, fitted not populated; JP2 picks 12 V or 5 V fans (section 10's open choice)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
